pageType: cover
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#FFFFFF"
elements:
  - elementId: edge-block
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 10, 540]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}

  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 84, 600, 18]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      letterSpacing: 3
      wrap: false
      text: 硕士毕业设计 · 初版方案讨论稿

  - elementId: kicker-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 114, 56, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}

  - elementId: main-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 134, 832, 104]
    content:
      fontFamily: 思源宋体
      fontSize: 37
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.35
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>面向 SLO 的知识库缓存动态优化的</p>
        <p>流式 Agent 推理系统</p>

  - elementId: sub-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 250, 832, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$sub"
      wrap: false
      text: SLO-Oriented Dynamic Knowledge-Base Cache Optimization for Streaming Agent Inference（暂定题）

  - elementId: intro
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 288, 792, 74]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$sub"
      lineHeight: 1.7
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        多轮 Agent 会话让大模型推理从「每次独立完成的一次计算」变成「跨轮、跨会话可复用的状态」。本研究用 Flink 键控状态承载这份「语义记忆」，在端到端时延 SLO 与错误率预算双约束下，用最小的缓存容量与推理资源服务动态负载。

  - elementId: motif-node-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 392, 110, 34]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [14000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$soft"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: motif-node-1-t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 392, 110, 34]
    content: {fontSize: 10.5, color: "$sub", align: [center, middle], text: Source}
  - elementId: motif-a1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [178, 406, 24, 6]
